<urn:beads-cache:finding:C4-FTQ-001> triage:qa6ConsumerFix "{\"evidence\": \"/tmp/phase-c-execution/c-2/qa6-fix/developer-result.json\", \"qa\": \"Independent QA7 required; canonical finding remains open. No self-approval.\", \"status\": \"process_source_corrected_and_native_control_pass_runtime_tests_sdk_blocked\", \"summary\": \"Production daemon uses public run_with_cleanup_and_bound to emit canonical listener-bound event with actual endpoint/PID. Process fixture requests port0 and verifies only newly appended live-child event, actual continuous competing-bind refusal/instance lock and health/readiness; held-socket collision fails once and cleans up. Runtime fixture source controls preserved; their causal execution remains SDK-blocked.\"}" .
